'''Ronald Mack Lewis, II''' (born November 17, 1972) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was an [[offensive lineman]] in the [[National Football League]] (NFL) for the [[Washington Redskins]].<ref>{{cite news |author=<!-- not stated --> |date=September 25, 1995 |title=In other Redskins news Tuesday |url=https://www.newspapers.com/article/news-and-messenger-in-other-redskins-new/181265092/ |work=[[News and Messenger]] |access-date=September 17, 2025}}</ref> He played [[college football]] at [[West Los Angeles College]] and [[Washington State University]].

