'''Ronald Arthur LaPointe''' (born February 28, 1957) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player. He played [[tight end]] in the [[National Football League]] (NFL) for two seasons; one each with the [[History of the Indianapolis Colts|Baltimore Colts]] and the [[Oakland Raiders]]. He played [[college football]] for the [[Penn State Nittany Lions football|Penn State Nittany Lions]].
